 popularized by iconic mid-century artists.\n\nModern recordings that successfully replicate these historical aesthetics are highly valuable for this specific catalog expansion. Instrumentation might include clean electric guitars, driving percussion, and traditional vocal harmonies that define the golden oldies era.\n\nBoth vocal songs and instrumentals must demonstrate a genuine commitment to these classic genres without leaning on contemporary production flourishes. This effort covers a broad range of styles from upbeat rockabilly to soulful adult standards, ensuring we can compile a comprehensive selection of music that feels genuinely nostalgic and timeless.\n\nSubmit Now (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=131fef9f3b&e=fb0210bba0)\n\n\n** The 6-Pack Is Back for 2026!\n------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Broadjam 6-Pack Songwriting Competition consists of six individual songwriting challenges, each with its own unique theme. Submit songs today! (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=b6cd90c149&e=fb0210bba0)\nhttps://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=aca18eb1bd&e=fb0210bba0\n\n============================================================\n** Facebook (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=e51ae1d129&e=fb0210bba0)\n** Twitter (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0ea6a7e0c3&e=fb0210bba0)\n** Instagram (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=c242f9094e&e=fb0210bba0)\n** YouTube (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=81fc15dc3a&e=fb0210bba0)\n You have received this email because you are opted in from your Broadjam account. To update your email preferences, please go to https://www.broadjam.com/artists/myprivacy.php\n\nOur mailing address is:\nBroadjam\nPO Box 187\nBarneveld, WI 57507\nUSA\n** unsubscribe from this list (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/unsubscribe?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&t=b&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d)\n** update subscription preferences (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/profile?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d)\n Email Marketing Powered by Mailchimp\nhttps://login.mailchimp.com/signup/email-referral/?aid=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Broadjam, All rights reserved.", "messageTimestamp": "2026-05-15T15:00:53Z", "payload": {"body": {"size": 0}, "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Subject", "value": "Contemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted"}, {"name": "From", "value": "Broadjam <listings@broadjam.com>"}, {"name": "Reply-To", "value": "<us7-e8d2f44bea-1882471d7b@inbound.mailchimpapp.net>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "Gerry <gerrymorgan26@gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Fri, 15 May 2026 15:00:53 +0000"}, {"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5.fb0210bba0.20260515150018.4fa20bc87d.8f39e241@mail28.sea31.mcsv.net>"}, {"name": "List-Unsubscribe", "value": "<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/unsubscribe?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&t=h&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d>, <mailto:unsubscribe-mc.us7_fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5.4fa20bc87d-fb0210bba0@unsubscribe.mailchimpapp.net?subject=unsubscribe>"}, {"name": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/alternative; boundary=\"_----------=_MCPart_2060602275\""}], "mimeType": "multipart/alternative", "partId": "", "parts": [{"body": {"data": "https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=ba64fe804b&e=fb0210bba0\r\nContemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted\r\nLooking for: music that mirrors the specific sonic characteristics of the fifties and sixties. Submissions should feature the distinct arrangements and production styles associated with early rock and roll, doo-wop, and vintage R&B. The focus remains on capturing the authentic energy and songwriting structures popularized by iconic mid-century artists.\r\n\r\nModern recordings that successfully replicate these historical aesthetics are highly valuable for this specific catalog expansion. Instrumentation might include clean electric guitars, driving percussion, and traditional vocal harmonies that define the golden oldies era.\r\n\r\nBoth vocal songs and instrumentals must demonstrate a genuine commitment to these classic genres without leaning on contemporary production flourishes. This effort covers a broad range of styles from upbeat rockabilly to soulful adult standards, ensuring we can compile a comprehensive selection of music that feels genuinely nostalgic and timeless.\r\n\r\nSubmit Now (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=131fef9f3b&e=fb0210bba0)\r\n\r\n\r\n** The 6-Pack Is Back for 2026!\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\nThe Broadjam 6-Pack Songwriting Competition consists of six individual songwriting challenges, each with its own unique theme. Submit songs today! (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=b6cd90c149&e=fb0210bba0)\r\nhttps://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=aca18eb1bd&e=fb0210bba0\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n** Facebook (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=e51ae1d129&e=fb0210bba0)\r\n** Twitter (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0ea6a7e0c3&e=fb0210bba0)\r\n** Instagram (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=c242f9094e&e=fb0210bba0)\r\n** YouTube (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=81fc15dc3a&e=fb0210bba0)\r\n You have received this email because you are opted in from your Broadjam account. To update your email preferences, please go to https://www.broadjam.com/artists/myprivacy.php\r\n\r\nOur mailing address is:\r\nBroadjam\r\nPO Box 187\r\nBarneveld, WI 57507\r\nUSA\r\n** unsubscribe from this list (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/unsubscribe?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&t=b&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d)\r\n** update subscription preferences (https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/profile?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d)\r\n Email Marketing Powered by Mailchimp\r\nhttps://login.mailchimp.com/signup/email-referral/?aid=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Broadjam, All rights reserved.", "size": 2984, "_sanitized": true}, "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain; charset=\"utf-8\"; format=\"fixed\""}], "mimeType": "text/plain", "partId": "0"}, {"body": {"data": "Looking for: music that mirrors the specific sonic characteristics of the fifties and sixties. Submissions should feature the distinct arrangements an |  |  |  [ ](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=11c495dcb9&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  |  Contemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted   \n---  \n|  |  **Looking for:** music that mirrors the specific sonic characteristics of the fifties and sixties. Submissions should feature the distinct arrangements and production styles associated with early rock and roll, doo-wop, and vintage R&B.; The focus remains on capturing the authentic energy and songwriting structures popularized by iconic mid-century artists.   \n  \nModern recordings that successfully replicate these historical aesthetics are highly valuable for this specific catalog expansion. Instrumentation might include clean electric guitars, driving percussion, and traditional vocal harmonies that define the golden oldies era.   \n  \nBoth vocal songs and instrumentals must demonstrate a genuine commitment to these classic genres without leaning on contemporary production flourishes. This effort covers a broad range of styles from upbeat rockabilly to soulful adult standards, ensuring we can compile a comprehensive selection of music that feels genuinely nostalgic and timeless.   \n  \n  \n---  \n|  [Submit Now](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e24a1c391&e=fb0210bba0> \"Submit Now\")  \n---  \n|  | \n\n##  The 6-Pack Is Back for 2026! \n\nThe Broadjam 6-Pack Songwriting Competition consists of six individual songwriting challenges, each with its own unique theme. [Submit songs today!](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=8802e4d6e8&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  [ ](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=ba774fa8b6&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|   \n---  \n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  [](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=4ef080b4d3&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  |  [](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=6fc173b211&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  |  [](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=2886faa593&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  |  [](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/track/click?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=007b8ad957&e=fb0210bba0>)  \n---  \n|  You have received this email because you are opted in from your Broadjam account. To update your email preferences, please go to https://www.broadjam.com/artists/myprivacy.php   \n  \n**Our mailing address is:**   \nBroadjamPO Box 187Barneveld, WI 57507  \n[Add us to your address book](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/vcard?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e>)   \n  \n[unsubscribe from this list](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/unsubscribe?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&t=b&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d>)    [update subscription preferences](<https://broadjam.us7.list-manage.com/profile?u=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5&id=0e7cf9f10e&e=fb0210bba0&c=4fa20bc87d>)    \n  \n[](<https://login.mailchimp.com/signup/email-referral/?aid=fbf692e76a8068f38f5df0ee5>)  \n---  \n|  _Copyright \u00a9 2026 Broadjam, All rights reserved._  \n---", "size": 56347, "_sanitized": true}, "filename": "", "headers": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html; charset=\"utf-8\""}], "mimeType": "text/html", "partId": "1"}]}, "preview": {"body": "Looking for: music that mirrors the specific sonic characteristics of the fifties and sixties. Submissions should feature the distinct arrangements an Contemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted", "subject": "Contemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted"}, "sender": "Broadjam <listings@broadjam.com>", "subject": "Contemporary Tracks With 50s/60s Influence Wanted", "threadId": "19e2c27cdb6214a1", "to": "Gerry <gerrymorgan26@gmail.com>"}, "error": null, "successful": true}  